# Claude Code working dir (AGENTS.md: never stage)
.claude/

# Entire Doc/ directory: local-only scratch space (hospital mock exports,
# real-SOAP-capture samples, screenshots, working notes). Hospital exports
# in particular use U+2011 (non-breaking hyphen) in the filename, which an
# ASCII-hyphen pattern does NOT match (the U+2011 lead byte differs from
# '-') - a directory-level ignore sidesteps that entirely. Anything meant
# to ship (PRD, architecture docs) belongs under docs/, not Doc/, and
# nothing here should ever reach a deployment target (issue #42/#43: the
# bastion host must run against the real SOAP gateway, never local mock
# data, so this directory must not exist there at all).
# The docs/ vs Doc/ split is documented in docs/README.md - add new
# shippable docs under docs/ and register them in that index.
Doc/

# Raw SOAP gateway captures (real patient data via curl/SoapUI against the
# hospital's DHC/Ensemble EnsWebService) - never stage.
tmp.md
/tmp.*.md
cmd.md